    "marks": "Supported text marks: {names}",
    "limits": "Limits: 1 MiB of JSON, 200,000 text characters, 8,000 nodes and 24 nested levels.",
    "media": "For image/audio nodes, use attrs.src with the public URL of media uploaded in the selected app. Do not add asset_id or Base64 data. YouTube URLs are supported; uploaded videos and files use text with a link mark. Media ownership is checked when the post is saved.",
    "attributes": "Common attributes: heading → level (1–6); orderedList → start, type; codeBlock → language; image → src, alt, title, width, height; link mark → href, target, rel, class, title. Use content arrays for child nodes and marks arrays on text nodes.",
